nk", "set", "attach", "pass", "expect", "adjust", "infringe", "compare", "go", "protect", "remove", "drive", "depend", "contain", "configure", "look", "execute", "delay", "fill", "trigger", "communicate", "provide", "treat", "take", "do", "monitor", "subject", "appreciate", "bleed", "wrap", "preheat", "relieve", "devise", "check", "evacuate", "receive", "winterize", "purify", "tube", "defrost", "introduce", "apply", "form", "prevail", "deliver", "connect", "associate", "heat up", "confirm", "reach", "flash", "sterilize", "comprise", "regard", "cut off", "accord", "approach", "suppress"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-0008176-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the water is drawn off at the water temperature prevailing in the receptacle, the addition of that water to the flow through the heat exchanger in which the waste water gives off heat does not result in any cooling of this flow with the above- mentioned concomitant disadvantages and risks of freezing in the heat exchanger"}, {"pat_id": "EP-0354914-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "installations of water-air heat exchangers of different kinds, heat batteries in air conditioning equipment, ordinary water radiators etc often have problems with pipe ruptures due to freezing in low air temperatures"}, {"pat_id": "EP-0527545-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as the ambient temperature has dropped to about 5 c or below, the first valve is heated by a heater in which it is housed, thereby preventing its freezing"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3769176-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "temperature sensor 38 is used to collect real-time temperature data and monitor the temperature of the incoming water to determine if conditions are conducive to pipe freezing"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3706682-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "[0069] (7) the first, second, and third short line cords are power cords, but instead, the first, second, and third short line cords themselves are self-temperature-controlled tropics t since the shape joint can be heated sufficiently by the connector itself, the effect of preventing freezing becomes more remarkable"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3706683-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "[0064] (5) the first, second, and third short wire cords are power cords, but instead, the first, second, and third short wire cords themselves are self-temperature-controlled tropics t since the shape joint can be heated sufficiently by the connector itself, the effect of preventing freezing becomes more remarkable"}, {"pat_id": "JP-S5851260-Y2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an anti-freeze valve 2 (low-temperature valve) connected to piping 1 is used to prevent freezing by lowering the water temperature to a temperature equal to or close to that of the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0167322-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, by controlling the water temperature of the purified water to prevent the formation of freezing inside the cold water storage tank, there is an advantage that the capacity of the cold water storage tank is not reduced"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "under the control of the drive means and the control means, the temperature of the cold water tank is raised to prevent freezing of the cold water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more particularly, the present invention relates to a temperature control device of a cold / hot water purifier that prevents freezing of a cold water tank according to an external temperature, and a method thereof"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention has been made to solve the above problems, an object of the present invention is to determine the freezing of the cold water tank according to the changing product internal temperature and cold water temperature to determine the freezing of the cold water tank even in the winter at low room temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "four-way valve driving means for driving control of the four-way valve to prevent freezing of the cold water tank, it is characterized in that the compressor driving means for controlling the drive to increase the temperature of the cold water tank according to the control to prevent freezing of the cold water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is determined whether or not the preset ice generating temperature tcd (cold water temperature at which freezing occurs in the cold water tank)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result of the determinat