rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to provide a malodor leakage prevention device capable of smoothly performing an excellent discharge operation and an odor shielding function by ensuring stability of operation and a rainwater receiver equipped with the same"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200338835-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and during rainy season, when rainwater, wastewater, and dirt flow into the manhole body 100, the rainwater, wastewater, and dirt flow into the manhole body 100 while flowing along the inclined surface 5 of the shielding plate (1)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200487197-Y1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "in addition, the sewage odor shielding device according to the present invention is variable in response to the shape of the drainage rainwater reservoir, thereby facilitating the installation according to the shape of the drainage rainwater reservoir of various colors"}]</data>
