  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100877621-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover of the sump is characterized in that formed of a transparent body that can identify the inside of the tank.according to the ozone oxidation type wastewater treatment device which strengthens the pretreatment process of the present invention, the pretreatment can be treated irrespective of the amount of wastewater including rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the initial rainwater introduced into the rainwater toil 210 is introduced into the septic tank 30, and the initial rainwater introduced into the septic tank 30 is a series of decay tanks 31, a filtration tank 32, an oxidation tank 33 and , and is stored in the storage tank 40 in a purified state via the disinfection tank 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}]</data>
