  <data key="d5">["urethane", "drop", "impact", "weather", "dismantling", "function", "inlet", "drain", "ice", "method", "separation", "discharge", "formation", "matter", "risk", "tear", "accident", "vehicle", "protection", "meter", "catchment", "groundwater", "rain", "slide", "amount", "air", "valve", "barrel", "sewage", "temperature", "season", "pipe", "material", "portion", "traffic", "installation", "corrosion", "collection", "water", "cause", "space", "solution", "freezing", "problem", "summer", "time", "rainwater", "insulation", "drinking", "part", "road", "plate", "device", "opening", "inflow", "order", "bottom", "accumulation", "addition", "change", "unit", "tank", "height", "receiving", "factor", "winter", "mean", "outside", "example", "surface", "underground", "moisture", "invention", "oxidation", "closing", "tube", "form", "environment"]</data>
  <data key="d6">["instal", "transfer", "evaporate", "make", "freeze", "adjust", "be", "protect", "drive", "flow", "close", "drain", "fill", "discharge", "slip", "block", "store", "solve", "lower", "devise", "relate", "use", "facilitate", "occur", "introduce", "form", "accumulate", "connect", "rain", "slide", "prevent", "leak"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100942717-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "insulation material (10ac) is filled in the separation space formed between the first plate (10aa) and the second plate (10ab) can be used in the form of urethane, the winter of the water tank (10) by the temperature drop outside, such as it prevents freezing of rainwater stored inside to prevent the collection tank 10 from freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a rainwater sewage receiving device which prevents freezing of the sewage flowing into the sewage inlet pipe by preventing cold air from being transferred from the upper portion thereof"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the function of adjusting the height in addition to preventing freezing is to connect the rainwater discharge pipe 120 and the sewage inflow pipe 130 to previously installed rain pipes and sewage pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101351825-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent the rainwater from easily evaporating during the rain or to prevent the catchment unit 120 from freezing or freezing by lowering the temperature, the inlet opening and closing part 125 is, for example, the opening and closing slide 125a sliding over the inlet 121"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if water cannot be drained due to freezing, rainwater or other rainwater cannot be discharged, making it difficult to drive smoothly due to accumulation on the road surface, and there is a risk of vehicle slipping or traffic accidents due to black ice due to thin ice formation on the road surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "can occur in particular, when the water meter is installed underground, it is difficult to completely prevent freezing of the water meter in winter because it is vulnerable to the inflow of moisture, groundwater, and rainwater from underground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in order to sufficiently prevent freezing of the water meter, a method capable of blocking the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "by means of the above solution, the present invention protects the water meter from physical factors such as external environment or impact and at the same time blocks the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc., thereby sufficiently preventing freezing of the water meter in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200163545-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and prevents foreign matters and rainwater from accumulating around the valve tube, and facilitates the installation and dismantling of the drinking water and prevents freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449313-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, in winter, a small amount of water (rainwater or tears) accumulated on the bottom of the barrel can be quickly drained to the outside to prevent freezing of the barrel.in the agricultural season, water is leaked along the barrel by blocking the drain pipe"}]</data>
</edge>
