ants for the subsequent building drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100593258-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "in the boundary block system capable of drainage, installed between the sidewalks and the driveway, the wheels of the vehicle are removed to serve as a boundary between the sidewalks and the roadway, to drain the rainwater on the roadway, and to prevent the vehicle from rushing to the sidewalk due to the collision with the car"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100593258-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "another object of the present invention to provide a boundary block system that can prevent backflow and block the odor generated in the drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100593258-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "still another object of the present invention is to provide a boundary block system that is easy to clean the drainage path and that can substantially increase the running area of the vehicle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in this way, the pollutants deposited on the road are transported to the road drainage due to rainfall, flowed into the sewer, and then discharged to the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the present invention has been proposed to solve the above problems, and has been deposited on the road surface while having the road drainage capacity of the rain can smoothly drain the increased road surface drainage during rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, the present invention satisfactorily removes contaminants such as insecticides and herbicides contained in the drainage in the field, and suspended matters contained in the water falling out after the harrowing prior to planting, so that these suspended matters are flowed into the river or the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "a discharge box (91) having an outlet partition wall (61) for storing contaminants after the contaminants are filtered and for dra