ntaneously blocked due to a foreign object such as fallen leaves or a large amount of water due to a heavy rain or heavy rain, various foreign substances that are swept away with the water are disposed on the upper part of the drain cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101178211-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention is to block the upper surface of the drain cover due to foreign matters, or in particular, even when a large amount of water in a moment of heavy rain or heavy rains can be drained smoothly without clogging with foreign matter, so that the water around the drain cover it not only prevents seizing but also provides excellent effects to prevent flooding and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101229485-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, when a large amount of water is instantaneously blocked due to a foreign object such as fallen leaves or a large amount of water due to a heavy rain or heavy rain, various foreign substances that are swept away with the water are disposed on the upper part of the drain cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flowing in the valley or the drainage channel of the retaining wall is suddenly flowed by the heavy rain, and the flowing velocity is a reality that there is a high risk of erosion or collapse of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by providing the guide block 66 on the upper side of the drainage passage 52, rainwater that suddenly overflows due to heavy rainfall or the like is prevented, so that flooding of the earths due to heavy rainfall can be stably prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101519076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result, the rainwater flowing in the valleys and the drainage channels is suddenly blown up by heavy rainfall, and the flow velocity is a real danger of erosion or collapse of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102308019-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the odor blocking device of the present invention, not only the upper member but also the lower member are floated by buoyancy during heavy rain to completely open the sewer pipe, thereby effectively draining a large amount of water due to the heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476350-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0761560 (2007.09.18)accordingly, the present invention has been proposed to solve the above conventional problems, and an object of the present invention is to be installed in a drain manhole where a grating is installed to block odors rising from the drain manhole at normal times and to drain water in the event of sudden heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476350-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention is installed in the sewer manhole where the grating is installed by these main components to block the odor rising from the sewer manhole in the odor blocking mode normally, and quickly switch to the drainage mode for smooth drainage in the event of sudden heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476351-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0761560 (2007.09.18)accordingly, the present invention has been proposed to solve the above conventional problems, and an object of the present invention is to be installed in a drain manhole where a grating is installed to block odors rising from the drain manhole at normal times and to drain water in the event of sudden heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102476351-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention is installed in the sewer manhole where the grating is installed by these main components to block the odor rising from the sewer manhole in the odor blocking mode normally, and quickly switch to the drainage mode for smooth drainage in the event of sudden heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102677255-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, if the drainage capacity is exceeded due to heavy rain, the inner floor of the gutters the situation is that foreign substances, including tire dust, oil, heavy metals caused by automobiles, and tire wear particles, are flowing back"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102702375-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this way, when various types of waste are repeatedly introduced and the amount of waste accumulated inside the rainwater drain increases, the drainage channels connected to the inside of the rainwater drain become blocked, and when the amount of rainwater inflow increases suddenly, such as during heavy rain, drainage becomes difficult, and the rainwater may flow back to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an apparatus for preventing inverse current of sewage the present invention relates to a sewage backflow prevention device, and more specifically, to prevent the inundation of low-level and basement housing, such as to block the sewage or sewage flow back from the drain to which the sewage and sewage is combined in a heavy rain or rainy season, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2b is a cross-sectional view showing a state of blocking backflow of sewage and sewage, in which the sewage or sewage is rapidly increased due to a rainy season or a heavy rain in the summer season and is not drained due to a rapid drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2a.as described above, the present invention is capable of blocking sewage or sewage that flows back from a drainage hole in which sewage and sewage are combined in a heavy rain or rainy season, and thus, has an effect of preventing flooding of lowland and basement houses"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200367365-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention has the advantage of forming eco-friendly to block the harmfulness of the water pipe 10 and the connecting bridge 20 to facilitate the material circulation of the ecosystem, the drainage during the rainy season and heavy rains that rain a lot"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200448229-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the above-described invention is effective for blocking odor and drainage, but it is necessary to discharge the water in the sewage pipe to the outside in order to prevent breakage of the sewage pipe when the rainwater is filled with rainwater and the pressure is applied to the sewage pipe due to heavy rain"}]</data>
