  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100607882-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the sewage from which the chemical is removed passes through the carbon block 7 and passes through the cover 11 and is discharged to the river through the drain 5 formed lower than the height of the filter box 6"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614766-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, the present invention satisfactorily removes contaminants such as insecticides and herbicides contained in the drainage in the field, and suspended matters contained in the water falling out after the harrowing prior to planting, so that these suspended matters are flowed into the river or the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100960367-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, the water introduced into the drain pit 18d through the drain pipe 18c is stored in the drain pit 18d by the height at which the outlet 18e is formed, and then discharged into the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100960370-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, the water introduced into the drain pit 18d through the drain pipe 18c is stored in the drain pit 18d by the height at which the outlet 18e is formed, and then discharged into the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101017356-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at the same time, the sewage flowing through the inside of the drain pipe is configured to be automatically discharged by water pressure, and to prevent the backflow of river water during rainy weather, while painting the pattern and text on the front of the screen to block the open drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101017356-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a second shielding membrane hinged to the lower portion of the first shielding membrane to reduce odors in the drain pipe, to prevent backflow of river water, and to discharge wastewater by water pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101017356-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since the second shielding film 50 is in close contact with the exposed end surface of the drain pipe 200 through the packing 70, it is possible to prevent the river water flowing back through the drain pipe 200 during rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101238571-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the cleaning operation, by installing the upstream order wall 10 to block the inflow of river water and drain the water of the cleaning section, the water is exposed in the low area of the puddle while the riverbed is exposed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, during rain, the initial rainwater containing non-point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non-point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101965634-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the case of draining to the river, drainage derived from the hume pipe is drained into the river, and when the drainage is made to the soft ground, the ground subsidence is caused by continuous drainage, or the ground is collapsed do"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102335129-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, the conventional slope structure simply performs a drainage function to prevent collapse, and even if the inflow of polluted river water or polluted water due to rainfall flows into the interior of the slope structure, it cannot be purified and discharged, and there is a problem that may cause soil contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a joint fitting installation structure used for sewage, waterworks, roads, river banks, and landfill leachate drainage works to prevent leakage of the joints to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, leak treatment equipment is installed in joint sections of sewers used for sewerage, waterworks, roads, river dikes and landfill leachate drainage to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200420164-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to the blocking, there is an effect of preventing the backflow of the river to the drain pipe of the sewage pipe simply and conveniently"}]</data>
