  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1013611-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "metallic materials such as zinc, lead or copper, which are used as roofing material or in roof drainage systems, are subject to corrosion due to exposure to air and rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681956-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the protrusion (3) is the air is discharged through the air discharge portion 33, the rain is introduced from the rain inlet 121 by using stainless in the metal to prevent corrosion, such as rust due to rust"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681956-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the protrusions 3 may discharge air through the air discharge part 33 and use stainless steel among metals to prevent corrosion due to rust by rainwater flowing from the rainwater inlet 121"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681956-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the protrusion 3 is in the inner space 31 through the air outlet 33 air is discharged, and it is preferable to use stainless steel among metals to prevent corrosion by rust due to inflow of rainwater from the rainwater inlet 121"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100720157-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, as the backflow prevention plate is difficult to rotate due to the foreign matter between the shaft and the bearing part with corrosion of the rotating shaft, the backflow prevention plate is not closed after opening when drained, resulting in a problem that the odor is left behind"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100781790-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the protruding cylinder 21 is the air is discharged through the air outlet 211, it is preferable to use stainless steel in the metal to prevent the corrosion, such as rust due to the rain is introduced from the inlet (12)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101163609-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when debris is caught in the hinge shaft, which is the driving part, or the material changes such as corrosion as the seal elapses, the deodorizing function is lost, and the deodorizing plate is not opened properly in rainy weather, and thus the rainwater is not drained smoothly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101170311-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the initial rainfall storage tank 21 may be made of any one material selected from iron, stainless steel, polyethylene (pe) or concrete so as to prevent corrosion and damage caused by contaminants contained in the initial rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101181863-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the high-pressure injector 50 is installed in an airtight space that does not penetrate rainwater so as to be easy to maintain and prevent corrosion by rainwater through a manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, it is possible to prevent the entry of rainwater into the water-leveling protector 10, thereby providing a special effect of effectively preventing corrosion and rusting of the water-stop valve 7 due to rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102215279-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "however, although the above-described corrosion prevention drainage is not corroded by hydrogen sulfide in sewage or a concrete waterway pipe to prevent corrosion due to neutralization of concrete, the acid rain that can be applied to the polymer concrete drainage pipe is alkalinized and neutralized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102809593-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, it is a system that physically stores filtered rainwater in a rainwater storage tank without electronic devices by utilizing the gravity of falling rainwater, thereby reducing maintenance costs and providing a physical rainwater utilization system that does not require frequent maintenance due to corrosion or damage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200151725-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, because different concrete structures have less cohesive force, the drainage channels and the drains made of concrete structures have gaps, and when water penetrates into these gaps, they accelerate corrosion of the large concrete structures and shorten the life of the drains"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200339290-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "small water pump protection supporting box the present invention relates to a water pump protection support for protecting an agricultural water pump installed in an outdoor field, and more particularly, to an improved small water pump protection support for preventing corrosion in an exposed state such as rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200339290-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1) it can protect and support the water pump from the infrared, ultraviolet ray and rainy weather in outdoor field to prevent corrosion and extend the life of the water pump"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200372189-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the case of no rain water, the cover plate is brought into close contact with the lower part of the manhole cover net, and the odor inside the manhole is prevented from being released to the outside through the structure in which the cover sheet for preventing corrosion is thermally bonded to the cover plate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200478285-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the water supply and drainage line 250 is made of stainless steel so as not to cause corrosion, and comprises a water supply line for supplying water and a drain line for draining the used water"}, {"pat_id": "US-12085236-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "sources of moisture that can induce corrosion include rain, water leaks, and condensation, cooling water tower drift, deluge systems and steam tracing leaks"}]</data>
