ut the backflow allowable plate 50 is in close contact with the lower shielding plate 40 due to the water pressure of the backflow water flowing into the drainage space 41 of the lower shielding plate 40 the backflow allowance plate 50 which was in contact with the part 53 is rotated upward, and the inflow backflow water is smoothly flowed back while being drained through the central drain port 64"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101632920-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to provide a malodor leakage prevention device capable of smoothly performing an excellent discharge operation and an odor shielding function by ensuring stability of operation and a rainwater receiver equipped with the same"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the sea water purification facility 120 can not process all of the contaminated water even though the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value due to a large difference between heavy rain, heavy rain or tide water, and transports the polluted water to the land-based storage tank 140 through the first pipeline 150"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102524324-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore, in the shielding plate 130 of the present invention, when sewage is collected in the grating by the elastic force of the elastic spring 150 and pressure is applied to the shielding plate 130, the shielding plate 130 is applied by the elastic spring 150 it is opened and drained as much as the degree of suppression"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102524324-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "in addition, when water pressure is not applied to the shielding plate 130, the elastic force of the elastic spring 150 pushes the shielding plate 130 up and closes the drainage hole 103 to prevent foreign substances from entering the sewer through the draining hole 103"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102524324-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "play a role in addition, the material of the shielding plate 130 for shielding the drain hole 103 is preferably made of resin, because it is not corroded in a state exposed to the atmosphere, is light, and can be easily manufactured by injection molding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102524324-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "the length of the stopper 140 is preferably formed so that the shielding plate 130 has a length at least 50% open, because the degree of opening of the shielding plate 130 is 50% of the drainage hole 103"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200338835-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and during rainy season, when rainwater, wastewater, and dirt flow into the manhole body 100, the rainwater, wastewater, and dirt flow into the manhole body 100 while flowing along the inclined surface 5 of the shielding plate (1)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200343186-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and an auxiliary shielding plate installed at an upper side of the rain receiver, the maintenance tank, and the treatment tank to cover an area of the whole thereof, and having an auxiliary shield plate for shielding the upper opening of the treatment tank on one side of the bottom surface, and receiving the road surface drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the odor discharged through the drainage channel can be completely shielded by the shielding film formed in a plurality of compartments inside the frame body, and the water flowing into the drainage side flows through the cutout formed in the shielding film, so that smooth drainage is possible"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "281288 and 431808 may prevent the odor from being discharged by the opening and closing plate or the shielding film to some extent, but as the opening and closing plate or the shielding film is formed on the same line as the main body, there is a problem that is difficult to completely block the odor discharged to the outside through the drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_