  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100696883-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "plug the present invention relates to a reinforcing connector for preventing deformation of a plastic sewer pipe to reinforce a connection of a sewer pipe or a drain pipe to prevent leakage of the connection part and deformation of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100696883-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the external force is applied to the sewage pipe or drainage pipe is to support the sewage pipe by the upper and lower fixed frame 20 will be able to prevent the deformation of the conduit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100800335-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "substantially, the rainwater treatment tank 22 is not likely to have the same internal diameter of the rainwater treatment tank 22 that is mass produced due to the high probability of shrinkage or deformation during drying (cooling), and the index plate 14 is coupled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100975670-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by allowing the infiltration water of the ground to flow into the lower part of the rain receiver body 10 by the inflow drain hole 14, it is possible to prevent deformation due to an increase in the earth pressure acting on the rain receiver body 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101218770-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the support portion 10 is preferably installed in the sewer 110 to drain the rainwater and is formed of a rust-free metal material such as stainless steel that does not easily cause bending deformation due to external force"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101363436-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the gravel is filled between the outside of the rainwater reservoir 10 and the inside of the housing 40 to increase the weight of the housing 40 and at the same time prevent structural deformation of the housing 40 due to earth pressure"}]</data>
</edge>
