 spheres is installed at the upper portion to allow free transfer due to the water level difference"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200359694-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, if the inflow water is directly transmitted to the sedimentation tank 400 through the water level control pipe 340 installed in the modular wetland infrastructure (300) due to the inflow of excess flow screen 430 of the sedimentation tank 400 physical filtration occurs thereby preventing the inflow of untreated water directly into the contact oxidation tank 500"}, {"pat_id": "US-6423216-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in case the water in the filter chamber rises over a water level of the overflow weir 37 placed at the filtrate outflow chamber 36, the injected oxidation air cannot rise over the water surface of the filter chamber but can be moved to the outflow side, due to the air pressure by the water head difference with the outflow side"}]</data>
