  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101007019-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "at this time, the third non-power flow control device 15 also operates in the shielding direction due to the water pressure applied as the water level rises in the filtration tank 8"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101541589-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "wherein the indirect water intake accommodated in the water collection is disposed inside the air intake and the air intake, prevent catalyst while floating on the surface of the water intake indirect include shielding for lifting in accordance with the water level"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837300-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the water level control valve includes a cylindrical body through which the water level control valve is vertically passed, and a buoyant body for selectively shielding the first flow path and the second flow path while moving up and down the body"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the water level is lowered by the water purifying treatment facility 120 by the water purifying treatment facility 120 while the water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a preset reference value, onshore reservoir 140, which in case of difficulty"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a control unit for controlling driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump to transport the contaminated water to the land storage tank when the internal water level of the shielding facility is higher than a predetermined reference value, and the inside water level of the shielding facility can be adjusted by being transported in both directions between the storage tank and the polluted water storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, a pipeline is installed between the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant and the land storage tank, and the polluted water of the shielding facility is transported to the land storage tank by the pipeline, thereby reducing the water level in the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, by sensing in real time the water level inside the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant and the water level outside the sea surface, the polluted water in the shielding facility is transferred to the landfill tank, it can be surely prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, when the sea water purification facility 120 can not process all of the contaminated water even though the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value due to a large difference between heavy rain, heavy rain or tide water, and transports the polluted water to the land-based storage tank 140 through the first pipeline 150"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit 180 controls the driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump 170 to bypass the contaminated water to the land storage tank 140 when the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for example, in the case of the domestic west coast, the polluted water is transported to the land-based storage tank 140 through the polluted water storage tank 130, thereby indicating that the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 can be lowered"}]</data>
</edge>
