  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-3983776-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "for example, the machine-learning algorithm can be trained with data provided from the control unit server 104, data provided by the smart water valve 126, and data associated with the security system 148 to predict devices that are leaking water"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3983776-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in response to providing the data from each of the devices in the monitored property 102 to the trained model, the trained model can produce a predicted device that is leaking based on the detection by the smart water valve 126"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3983776-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "should the smart water valve produce a detection that water is leaking or the trained model predict a device that is leaking water in the monitored property 102, the control unit server 104 can provide that detection and/or prediction to the client device 122 of the property owner 120"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3983776-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "similarly, the security system 148 can transmit a command to the smart water valve 126 to move the position of the ball valve 208 to open in response to the trained machine-learning model predicting no device is leaking water"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5757052-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the auxiliary valve is installed on the outer periphery of the main valve and consists of a water shielding plate and a projecting floating body that floats it, and the outer periphery of the projecting floating body is used to prevent malfunction of the valve opening and closing due to the wave of rain water surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100420101-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a flow control valve having an integrally coaxially connected valve body capable of lifting up and down is accommodated inside the manhole cylinder, and the float rises due to a rise in the level of the rainwater introduced through the upper rainwater inlet pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100647994-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a filter member provided at the inlet side of the body to prevent a large amount of foreign substances from entering the body, a shutoff valve provided inside the body to block the rainwater introduced through the inlet at a predetermined amount"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100647994-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "side of the body (5) to prevent the inflow of bulky foreign matter 6 and a shutoff valve 7 provided inside the body 5 to shut off the rainwater flowing through the inlet 2 when the water flows in a predetermined amount, and the rainwater blocked by the shutoff valve 7"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100666662-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the drainage is completed in this way, the weight of the weight 123 of the lever valve 120 to the original position, the valve surface 122 can block the drain groove 141 to prevent the introduction of various wastes (fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100672275-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2, the general operation of the rainwater toss is usually performed by sliding the valve valve plate 17 to the lower guide block 27 of the torsion housing 1 by the operation of the drive motor 19"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681933-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the first method is to install water gates, valves, and movable wear to control the discharge amount at the outlet, and open these facilities at normal times to drain the reservoir water, and then close the water gate to settle down after a certain period of time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100699326-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and, the connecting valve 42 is a manure to prevent the failure of the device due to the pinch of the foreign matter caught in the bent portion of the connecting pipe 41 when the role of water purification and water purification is not made smoothly, it is configured to control inflow and block rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100706162-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when rainwater is introduced through the manhole cover 30 while the installation is completed as described above, the introduced rainwater is introduced into the odor blocking tube 110, and the rainwater is opened while the elastic valve 115 is opened by the load of the rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100706162-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, the elastic valve 115 is closed when all the rain water is discharged, the weight 111 of the odor blocking tube 110 when the elastic valve 115 is closed at all times the lowest level of sewage flowing through the inside of the manhole body 10 odor is blocked because it is located less than the discharge of the manhole cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100784989-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in treating rainwater containing a large amount of turbidity, a blockage due to a large amount of turbidity may occur in the chamber portion 210 of the vortex valve, so that an outflow downstream from the rainwater discharge portion 130 of the manhole body may occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100918431-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, the existing rain gutter backflow prevention device installed in the field is most often the case that the valve part to be closed by rust is open"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101056650-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the drain valve 158 is frequently opened to remove foreign substances when the rainwater reservoir tank 150 is cleaned or when foreign substances are deposited at the bottom"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101275666-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, on one side of the sump (1), in addition to the blocking of the odor, the reverse valve (7) for preventing the reverse flow is axially coupled to the hinge shaft (8) inclined axially configured to prevent odor or reverse flow while allowing drainage do"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101537963-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the valve 320 blocks the inflow of rainwater when the filter 331 installed in the filter housing 330 is exchanged, thereby facilitating a smooth filter replacement operation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id":