r level when there is no detection signal, the wear 100 is kept in an erect state, and an alarm for separate inspection is generated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102399563-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remote terminal device can determine and monitor the leakage of hazardous chemicals or the discharge of wastewater in the factory based on the gate status information and the water level information of the manhole water level sensor to be described later"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102451236-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when a lot of water is introduced into the rectangular girder p for a short period due to local heavy rain or rupture of the water pipe, and the water level rises, the resistance plate 34 of the water level sensing device 30 rotates and the magnetic sensor 35 a sensing signal is generated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102490690-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "pipe blockage prediction system pipe blockage prediction system the present invention relates to a system for predicting pipe clogging, and more specifically, when a plurality of water level sensors are installed in a pipe through which sewage, sewage, rainwater, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102595204-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the evaporator tray 1125 further comprises an evaporator tray water level sensor 1171 arranged to detect when the water level in the evaporator tray 1125 is above a predefined maximum water level, thereby causing the drain 1125b to be at least partially it will display that you are blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102595218-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the evaporator tray 1125 further comprises an evaporator tray water level sensor 1171 arranged to detect when the water level in the evaporator tray 1125 is above a predefined maximum water level, thereby causing the drain 1125b to be at least partially it will display that you are blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102595234-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the evaporator tray 1125 further comprises an evaporator tray water level sensor 1171 arranged to detect when the water level in the evaporator tray 1125 is above a predefined maximum water level, thereby causing the drain 1125b to be at least partially it will display that you are blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102807029-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit can block the inflow of water before the equipment inside the main body housing (10) is affected by the inflow of water through the water level sensor"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102879590-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and a batch type wastewater treatment system characterized by including a control unit that controls the rectifier lifting unit according to the signal of the sensor, thereby raising the rectifier in conjunction with the rise in the water level of the reaction tank when wastewater flows in"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200323476-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "into the flow rate adjustment tank 30 in a state in which the coarse contaminant is filtered and removed while passing through), and when the water level detection sensor 33 of the flow adjustment tank 30 detects the water level, the raw water pump 31 according to the detected signal"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200427833-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when water level is measured by sensor detection while blocking the inflow of floating garbage, it automatically adjusts the rainwater inflow switch to block the inflow"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "another object of the present invention is to maintain a constant water level using a float valve and to supply a constant concentration of brine to the electrolysis tank so that sodium hypochlorite is equipped with an automatic valve and a flow sensor to produce a constant concentration of sodium hypochlorite it is to provide a generator"}, {"pat_id": "US-10480824-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "further, water (either from a leak condition or a non-leak condition (condensation)) may accumulate in the bottom pan 200 and trigger the leak sensor 1200