ay be included in the rainwater flowing into the collection pipe 20"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101258565-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, it is preferable that the area of the blocking plate 260 is made larger than the wastewater inlet 22 and the opening 110 to control the inflow of rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101258565-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the rainwater introduced into the rainwater chamber 10 is increased in quantity and gradually increased in water level to reach the moving induction plate 300 installed in the sewage inlet 22 and the blocking plate 260"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101314575-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, the discharge pipe is integrally coupled to the membrane module to be lifted together, so that the c type opening side of the discharge inlet is disposed on a vertical line with the rainwater inlet to prevent mutual interference during vertical lifting of the discharge inlet"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323288-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, when the flow into the rainwater inlet pipe 5 is not smooth due to the contaminants introduced into the rainwater inlet 200 together with the rainwater, some of the rainwater flowing into the rainwater inlet 200 is the rainwater inlet 200"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "first, if rainwater is supplied through the inlet 1 of the single finishing block 20, it is stored while maintaining the same water level in the entire pipeline while flowing along the curved pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this is because the sediment contained in the initial rainwater is mainly deposited on the bottom of the block close to the inlet 1, so that the washing water is advantageously discharged in a direction opposite to the flow direction when the rainwater is supplied"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101326602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater drainage for roads apparatus for draining of rain water for road the present invention rel