  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1226314-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "if conduits draining a large balancing pond or tank of the prior art type become blocked, localised flooding could occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101194503-B1", "para_id": "claim_22", "text": "wherein the storage step is to receive the medium influent directly from the influent distribution tank in the medium concentration tank to temporarily store, and the contaminant concentration of the medium influent water is treated as a low concentration influent water through a chemical flocculation reaction multifunctional storage method to reduce initial water pollution and prevent urban flooding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101194503-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "figure 7 is a block diagram showing a p-uv sterilization apparatus in the disinfection tank provided in the multifunctional storage system for the initial excellent pollution reduction and urban flooding prevention according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel, causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel, causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200365446-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by using the control equipment, the water level difference between the upper and the downstream filtration tanks is maintained at 1.0-1.5m, so that the sediment deposited in the upper and the downstream filtration tanks can be gradually discharged during the initial flooding with less floating dust, thereby preventing the ultimate closure of the filter media"}, {"pat_id": "US-10865547-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the event of a truly significant rain (storm) event, these storage tanks can be overwhelmed, thus resulting in flooding or discharge of excess storm water to the sewage treatment system, a body of water, or a river"}, {"pat_id": "US-11603651-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the event of a truly significant rain (storm) event, these storage tanks can be overwhelmed, thus resulting in flooding or discharge of excess storm water to the sewage treatment system, a body of water, or a river"}, {"pat_id": "US-6105607-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "while this invention will not prevent leaks such as washing machine over flow hose rupture, dishwasher overflow, toilet tank flooding, etc"}, {"pat_id": "US-8691091-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the rapid air escape may also cause the filter media to jump vertically inside the filter tank, causing it to be lost through the drain line and possibly causing plugging of the drain and flooding"}]</data>
