  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1685069-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, upon using soft water, cold raw water low than normal temperature is supplied through the empty cold regenerating tank 2a into the cold water softening tank 4a, and the resulted cold soft water is discharged outside while hot raw water high than normal temperature is supplied through the empty hot regenerating tank 2b into the hot water softening tank 4b, and the resulted hot soft water is discharged outside"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3779320-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in the illustrated embodiment of the tank water heater 10 and the alternative embodiment of the tankless water heater, if the temperature of condensate is equal to or close to the temperature of room air, the controller 142 determines at box 245 that there is no leakage of water (from the tank 14, or from the heat exchanger coil in the alternative embodiment)"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3672455-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, since the activity of iron bacteria, that is, the oxidation amount of iron may change due to the influence of temperature, the measuring tank 10 is maintained at a temperature at which the activity of iron bacteria is stabilized by the temperature regulator 5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13, the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0167322-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, by controlling the water temperature of the purified water to prevent the formation of freezing inside the cold water storage tank, there is an advantage that the capacity of the cold water storage tank is not reduced"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "under the control of the drive means and the control means, the temperature of the cold water tank is raised to prevent freezing of the cold water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more particularly, the present invention relates to a temperature control device of a cold / hot water purifier that prevents freezing of a cold water tank according to an external temperature, and a method thereof"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention has been made to solve the above problems, an object of the present invention is to determine the freezing of the cold water tank according to the changing product internal temperature and cold water temperature to determine the freezing of the cold water tank even in the winter at low room temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "four-way valve driving means for driving control of the four-way valve to prevent freezing of the cold water tank, it is characterized in that the compressor driving means for controlling the drive to increase the temperature of the cold water tank according to the control to prevent freezing of the cold water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is determined whether or not the preset ice generating temperature tcd (cold water temperature at which freezing occurs in the cold water tank)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result of the determination in step s18, when the internal temperature tr is not equal to or below the freezing internal temperature trs (no), the indoor temperature where the cold / hot water purifier is installed and the cold water temperature tc of the cold water tank 7 are the normal temperature condition illuminator returns to the step s15 and repeats the operation of the step s15 or less"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if tc is not equal to or higher than the cold water set temperature tcs (no), it is determined that the freezing of the cold water tank 7 is not completely removed, and the flow returns to the step s21, where the fan motor under the compressor 35 while driving 39), the operation of step s21 and below is repeated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result of the discrimination in step s23, when the cold water temperature tc is equal to or higher than the cold water set temperature tcs (yes), it is determined that the freezing of the cold water tank 97 is completely removed, and the flow advances to step s24 to control means 110"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result of the determination in step s16, when the cold water temperature tc is equal to or lower than the freezing generation temperature tcd (yes), it is determined that the cold water tank 7 is frozen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0175895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the temperature control apparatus and the method of the cold / hot water purifier according to the present invention as described above, it is determined whether the cold water tank is freezing according to the changing product internal temperature and the cold water temperature, so that the cold water tank freezes even in the winter when the room temperature is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100271942-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "or higher, it is possible to prevent efficiency degradation such as nitrification reaction due to low outside air temperature during subsequent processing in the aeration tank 60"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100315762-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present invention, the composite panel 10 can be firmly assembled by fitting the composite panel 10 to the skeleton constituting each component panel of the large tank, so that the connection part of the composite panel 10 is caused by internal deformation pressure due to bending deformation or temperature change"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100328970-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the method of claim 1, the outer circumferential surface of the hopper tank 101, the appara