para_4", "text": "in this case, between the wall blocks 200 continuously arranged in the transverse direction to form the wall surface of the rainwater storage tank, the engaging portion of the recess portion 210 and the convex portion 220 is formed, and thus the strand wire 10 and the strand wire installation tool ( 100), the fastener 50, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101273679-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a contaminant separation tank 200 installed at a downstream side of the water collecting facility 100 to remove particulate contaminants from the rainwater collected by the water collecting facility 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101273679-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a contaminant separation tank 200 installed at a downstream side of the water collecting facility 100 to remove particulate contaminants from the rainwater collected by the water collecting facility 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101282720-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the present invention provides a long-term supply of the water required for landscape water while effectively storing rainwater flowing down by heavy rain on an inclined surface, and also to perform long-term landscaping by wicking the stored rainwater for the storage tank of the stacked blocks"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101301345-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, rainwater is circulated through the monthly circulation hole in the storage process, and a large amount of oxygen is supplied into the water, thereby improving water quality by natural purification.1 is a block diagram showing the overall prefabricated rainwater storage tank according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101308064-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is settled down and the rainwater flowing into the purification treatment tank 21 through the drain hole 230 is supplied with a considerable amount of contaminants separated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and af