vention, the sewage contaminants are separated from the sedimentation tank 20 while the overflow water and the initial rainwater from the combined sewage pipe pass through the purification treatment tank 10, soluble contaminants are removed from the filtration tank (30)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, the initial stormwater treatment apparatus 1 of the present invention quickly discharges rainwater, that is, residual water remaining in the purification treatment tank 10, to prevent the residual water from decaying"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101611948-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "next, in order to adjust the weakly acidic rainwater 3 to be weakly alkaline while removing the foreign substances contained in the rainwater 3 flowing into the inside of the ph adjusting tank 30, and a block 310 in which the elvan stone powder, the powdered activated carbon, and the powdered lime slurry are mixed in the middle portion of the ph adjusting tank 30"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101653780-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the sludge hopper 230 allows the sludge contained in the storm to flow into the backwash drainage storage tank 310 so that the contaminants separated from the backwashing means 220 due to the backwashing process, to the backwash drainage storage tank 310 side by a predetermined angle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101817003-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "next, the rainwater that has been purified through the water purification apparatus 2 is moved to the storage tank 3 along the connection line 52, thereby enabling a large amount of water to be supplied as moisture necessary for growing the water loss water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101865757-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional water treatment apparatuses such as storage tanks have a problem of non-environmental problems because the filtration efficiency of contaminants contained in rainwater such as early storms is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1",