orage tank is circulated inside can be"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102391446-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "specifically, the control device 30 may determine whether filter cleaning is necessary by checking whether the water level in the water tank is equal to or greater than a preset threshold value based on the water level detection information"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102434590-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the end part is immersed in the water level of undischarged sewage that always remains in the storage state in the sewage tank, so that the negative effects such as contamination of indoor air due to odors during the sewage discharge operation can be eliminated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102436761-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the end part is immersed in the water level of undischarged sewage that always remains in the storage state in the sewage tank, so that the negative effects such as contamination of indoor air due to odors during the sewage discharge operation can be eliminated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102500623-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "an anti-corrosion coating is applied to the outer periphery of the lower part installed inside the wastewater treatment tank 100 to measure the water level inside the tank and prevent corrosion by the sterilizing solution"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102525037-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the pressure tank 100 may be provided with a water level measurement unit (not shown) and a drainage unit 170 for adjusting the water level, and a water level gauge 180 for checking the water level from the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102554668-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "will leak control unit 112 is configured to cause ro pump 450 to stop pumping if empty level switch 350a in tank 350 detects air or a critically low water level"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102718430-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "in addition, the water level inside the aeration tank (33) gradually rises due to the bubbles, causing untreated water inside the aeration tank (33) to overflow to the outside, and there may be a problem in that public complaints are generated due to bad odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102783510-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "when the water level of the rainwater storage tank (200) reaches the minimum water level (h2), the agitating unit (500) is driven to form a flow to prevent the decay of the water stored in the rainwater storage tank (200)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102879590-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and a batch type wastewater treatment system characterized by including a control unit that controls the rectifier lifting unit according to the signal of the sensor, thereby raising the rectifier in conjunction with the rise in the water level of the reaction tank when wastewater flows in"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102903436-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "is opened by the bending deformation of the elastic membrane (95), so that the amount of polluted air input through the horizontal passage (14) increases, and when the water level in the water tank (91)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102903436-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "is opened by the bending deformation of the elastic membrane (95), so that the amount of polluted air introduced through the horizontal channel (14) increases, and when the water level in the water tank (91)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200145021-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2 is a block diagram of a water purifier to which the water level deviation preventing device of the purified water tank according to the present invention is applied"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200167943-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to one feature of the automatic water supply device of