  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1218293-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger"}, {"pat_id": "EP-1228003-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5295753-B2", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "for this reason, the precipitation of salt in the connection pipe does not block the connection pipe and prevent the supply of the cleaning liquid from the cleaning agent tank to the cleaning liquid tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101014995-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the amount of water increases, the water level sensor detects and opens the initial rainwater blocking door to remove the foreign matter from the primary strainer after collecting the rainwater from the primary strainer, filter it once more from the strainer, and then remove the foreign substance in the sedimentation chamber for final precipitation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102052855-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is possible to control the discharge level of the treated wastewater, and to selectively block the supply of microbubbles inside the separation tank to use the separation tank as a sedimentation tank, but to induce precipitation in the vertical direction or inclined direction downward to maximize the precipitation efficiency"}, {"pat_id": "US-5776333-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger 18"}, {"pat_id": "US-5858248-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "also, the air-cooler 25 will ensure that incoming raw water cannot be heated within the heat exchanger 18 to a temperature which would induce premature precipitation of dissolved solids in the incoming raw water, and thus lead to ultimate blockage inside the heat exchanger"}]</data>
