ll is changed according to the operation of the water pump (m), the sewage blocking air valve 40 is kept open so that air flows in and out of the groundwater, and the groundwater pollution prevention device is flooded by flooding or the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101254083-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the valve spool 42 is always buoyant in the submerged state, the close contact surface 42a of the valve spool 42 remains in close contact with the seat surface 41b of the valve cylinder 41, and thus the air passage 41a of the valve cylinder 41 is blocked, and the surface water due to the flooding is blocked from flowing into the groundwater well"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by providing the guide block 66 on the upper side of the drainage passage 52, rainwater that suddenly overflows due to heavy rainfall or the like is prevented, so that flooding of the earths due to heavy rainfall can be stably prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101841645-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the diameter of the water hole 311 formed in the block housing 30 is smaller than the diameter of the inlet hole 21 formed in the press plate 20, the number of the holes 311 is formed in the block housing 30 in a smaller number than the number of the inlet holes 21 formed in the press plate 20 so that the gap between the inlet holes 21 of the block housing 30 is discharged to the permeable hole (311) in a state of being filled with water, thereby preventing flooding or flooding due to abrupt discharge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101923707-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention also provides a device for continuously removing foreign matter flowing into a drainage channel together with rainwater, thereby preventing a flooding caused by blocking the drainage port with foreign matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102253598-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem in that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1 , the flooding diffusion prevention system may include a drain module 100 , a flood control module 200 , and a blocking module 300 so that water can be flushed and drained"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102399564-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the gate 20 not only collects an appropriate amount of sewage or rainwater by opening and closing the inlet, but also blocks the pressure from being transmitted into the collecting pipe due to the rise of the water level in the conduit during flooding to prevent damage to the collecting pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102569525-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "4 is a block diagram showing a control system of a drainage system for preventing road flooding according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole block manhole block the present invention relates to a manhole block, and more specifically, is manufactured by mixing recycled aggregate (recycled aggregate) and concrete in a certain ratio to provide sufficient strength as well as eco-friendliness through efficient use of resources, as well as internal flooding due to rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "because the manhole cover is structurally exposed to the ground of the road or sidewalk, especially when it rains heavily, there is a risk of rainwater flowing into the manhole block and internal flooding, no matter how airtight the sealing treatment is"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, especially in the rainy season or in the fall, foreign substances such as fallen leaves can block the inlet, making it difficult to drain, which can easily lead to flooding and human casualties"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2a.as described above, the present invention is capable of blocking sewage or sewage that flows back from a drainage hole in which sewage and sewage are combined in a heavy rain or rainy season, and thus, has an effect of preventing flooding of lowland and basement houses"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200328169-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, when the sewage flows back due to rainy season or flooding, the separation of the menhole cover 2 from the support frame 12 is expected by the blocking plate 8 blocking the through hole 10 of the manhole cover 2"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the drainage line becomes clogged or blocked with debris, ice, or as a result of build-up inside the pipe, a flooding event can occur in the building if adequate precautions are not taken"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "without proper maintenance, backwater valves can become blocked or stuck, giving building managers and homeowners a false sense of security that they will be protected during a flooding event"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however many homeowners and residents are not aware of the presence or operation of a backwater valve, and if the valve is closed due to a flooding event or blockage many residents will not be aware of it until sanitary sewage begins flowing back into their building"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in some embodiments, the incidents and the potential incidents may include, but not limited to, blockages or flooding in the sewer manhole 201 due to increasing/decreasing in level of wastewater in the sewer manhole 201, unauthorized tampering of sewer manhole 201, presence of flammable gas in the sewer manhole 201, battery level and battery performance of the one or more additional sensors and the level sensor"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "in some embodiments, the incidents and the potential incidents may include, but not limited to, blockages or flooding in the sewer manhole 201 due to increasing/decreasing a level of wastewater in the sewer manhole 201, unauthorized tampering of sewer manhole 201, presence of flammable gas in the sewer manhole 201, battery level, and battery performance of the one or more additional sensors and the level sensor"}]</data>
