nd to vent rainwater reservoirs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101206269-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater can be sent to the vegetation reservoir 170, and the degree of purification of rainwater can be increased by passing through a plurality of prefabricated blocks 102 and 103"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101239389-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, as a countermeasure for reducing the pollution, road drainage in urban areas is settled by installing a reservoir to settle contaminants caused by rain, and then discharge the agricultural drainage containing a large amount of fertilizer and pesticides discharged from agricultural land"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101282720-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the inner section of the reservoir 48 blocks the contact with the rainwater, and the fine soil or suspended matter contained in the rainwater is provided to be filtered while being contained in the cleaning bag 35"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101282720-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in the reservoir collection block 10 provided in the present invention, the water in a small stream or wetland or ground water flowing through the water according to the structure of the terrain is often required to purify due to environmental pollution"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101308064-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the inclined guide plate 25 is formed in a corrugated form and is inclined, the inclined guide plate 25 generates resistance to rainwater flow rate moving to the reservoir 2 to prevent rapid flow, while fine contaminants continuously impinge on the corrugated surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323288-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is not only to filter out pollutants introduced with rainwater to the storm pipe (5) side as well , removes low-density floating contaminants and sends them down to the reservoir penetrating portion (10c) side of the lower portion, the reservoir penetrating portion (10c) to send rainwater introduced from the infiltration vegetation portion (10b)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101326602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by opening a large amount of rainwater into the reservoir quickly and allowing it to be discharged into the drain, it is possible to respond quickly to the rainy weather conditions of the road, and also to prevent leakage of odors from the underground drainage to the outside and the introduction of foreign substances into the drain can be controlled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101326602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when a certain load (when a certain amount of rain is filled into the reservoir) is applied to the lifting plate 41a, the weight 41b opposite to the opening and closing plate 41a is lifted upward while the opening and closing plate 41a is axially rotated downward while the the bottom drain 11 is opened to drain the rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101351825-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in one embodiment, a sufficient amount of rainwater is stored in the side reservoir panel 130 to block the inflow of rainwater, or once stored so that foreign matter does not block the inlet 121 or the filter portion 122 while it is not raining"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101363436-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the gravel is filled between the outside of the rainwater reservoir 10 and the inside of the housing 40 to increase the weight of the housing 40 and at the same time prevent structural deformation of the housing 40 due to earth pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101468324-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10 (a), the third open / close board 40 of the present invention can be shut off passively, so that even when the rain is over in the event of an emergency, the river floods or exceeds the sewage treatment capacity of the sewage end treatment plant , it is possible to block a multiple of the initial storm stored in the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101730962-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the discharge level sensor reservoir 1912 is independent of other reservoirs to prevent contaminants from mixing the generated water with the drain water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102010653-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, since sediments generated during rainfall are often removed automatically before being deposited in the settlement or reservoir, the settlement or reservoir can always maintain the efficiency of the design capacity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200321399-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the filtration unit 10 is filtered while the rain water is passed through the pitcher block 11 in the rain, the heavy water is converted into the heavy water, the heavy water through the reservoir block 12, the drain hole 14 and the fitting pipe 15 ( 21)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414264-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the rainwater collection modification, the rainwater collection pipe 1 is connected to induce rainwater, and the rainwater collection pipe 1 is installed at the end of the rainwater contaminant treatment device, and a rainwater reservoir is connected to the end of the rainwater reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "US-12209051-B2", "para_id": "para_84", "text": "when there is heavy rainfall, a reservoir or tank may become overwhelmed by a sudden rush of water"}, {"pat_id": "US-6932540-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "surprisingly, although preferably highly opaque, the reservoir covers of the invention nevertheless allow rainwater to readily pass through, thereby avoiding inundation during storms and the like"}, {"pat_id": "US-6932540-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the reservoir covers of the invention further provide adequate liquid transport properties to drain rainwater from the surface of the cover into the reservoir, thereby avoiding inundation"}, {"pat_id": "US-8043094-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "similarly, the treatment of raw water (e.g., groundwater, lake water, reservoirs, rain water, etc.) to produce drinking water also includes the removal of chemical and biological contaminants"}]</data>
