  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101092761-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "9, the corrugated node 2 prevents breakage and freezing of the water supply pipe due to the vehicle moving load by preventing the pipe joint or the pipe rupture when the pipe is contracted and expanded, and prevents earthquake or ground subsidence"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101139331-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the joint connection panel 140 is fixed to the lower surface of the site where the plurality of base panels 100 installed in the longitudinal direction contact each other, the base panel 100 is the initial construction state due to ground subsidence, scour phenomenon, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, as the ground subsides or sags occur at the joints of the concrete hume pipes due to their own weight, the filled concrete mortar breaks, and sewage leaks between them, causing soil contamination, ground subsidence, and sinkholes, as well as various other problems"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102785830-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "and the outer joining groove (157), thereby improving the rigidity when an external impact or a harsh environment such as ground subsidence occurs at the joint of the combined profile (10), and preventing cracks or loosening at the joint"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102785830-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "and an outer diameter bonding groove (157) in a rough shape, even if a harsh environment such as an external impact or ground subsidence occurs at the joint of the connecting profile (10), the bonding force that holds them together is greatly improved, preventing cracks or loosening, thereby maintaining a stable installation state"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200203424-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since the pipe joints 1a and 2a are reinforced with a cylindrical reinforcement socket 10 made of polyethylene resin having good corrosion resistance, corrosion is suppressed, and pipes are crushed due to earth pressure and ground subsidence"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200342253-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as shown in the present invention, the mesh pipe 8 having a length corresponding to the joint pipe part 1 is connected to the joint pipe part 1 and the first, second, and third inner support pipes 3, 4, ( as provided between 3a), the mesh pipe (8) has the advantage that can further improve the safety against the risk of deformation and fracture due to external impact or ground subsidence"}]</data>
