ce"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200431389-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, regardless of the heavy rain or heavy rain, the initial rainfall is necessarily passed through the purification tank, it is possible to prevent the contamination of the river by the initial rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "US-11306164-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the filters may be attached, for example, to an oil tanker, in the event of an ocean or sea oil spill, or a tanker truck or the like, in the event of a land based (river, wastewater, plant waste, or the like) contamination"}]</data>
