  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-7222143-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the earthquake-resistant structure 10 configured in this manner can prevent water leakage from the pipeline 1 when the pipeline 1 is damaged by an earthquake or the like"}, {"pat_id": "JP-7222143-B1", "para_id": "para_48", "text": "that is, when a large load is applied to the pipeline 1 due to an earthquake or the like, by guiding the guide groove 20 covered with the water stop body 31 to be damaged, leakage of water or groundwater into the pipeline 1 can be prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of an immovable settlement caused by an earthquake or the like, there is a problem that the connection between the panels is broken, and leakage occurs in the broken part, thereby losing the function as a water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "seismic edge reinforcement means for reinforcing the connection between the unit panels on one side and the other side provided in multiple stages on one side and the other side of the peripheral edge of the water tank body to prevent leakage of water from the peripheral edge when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seismic edge reinforcement means for reinforcing the connection between the unit panels on one side and the other side provided in multiple stages on one side and the other side of the peripheral edge of the water tank body to prevent leakage of water from the peripheral edge when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "as shown in the drawing, the seismic smc water tank (hereinafter referred to as water tank ) according to the present invention is capable of preventing water leakage from occurring in the water tank by improving seismic performance when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the present invention is a useful invention that can prevent water leakage from occurring when the lower portions of the unit panels 22 of the lowermost layer of the water tank body 2 flow outward when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "by reinforcing the connection between the two, it serves to prevent leakage from occurring at the peripheral edge of the water tank body 2 when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in the present invention, by reinforcing the connection state of the circumferential edge of the water tank through the earthquake-resistant edge reinforcing means 5, a gap is generated in the circumferential edge of the water tank during the release of an earthquake to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102553769-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it relates to a drainage system of a pve waterproof floor plate with a waterproof function of an earthquake-resistant bathroom to prevent water leakage in addition to preventing leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102553769-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is to provide a drainage system of a pve floor plate with a waterproof function of an earthquake-resistant bathroom to prevent water leakage in addition to preventing leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "even if an impact is applied from the outside while buried in the pipe, damage can be prevented at the connection between drain pipes, and earthquake resistance and water leak prevention can be used to prevent twisting or water leakage at the connection to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102835470-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "or internal pipe (310), so that when an earthquake is detected in the smart valve body (200), the signal is transmitted to the control unit (400) to lock the first and second electric valves (311, 312), thereby preventing leakage of tap water in the event of an accident"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200377301-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "further, even if a crack occurs or a change in the connection state of the impact resistant pvc pipe due to natural phenomenon such as earthquake and ground subsidence caused by repeated shocks transmitted from the ground, the phenomenon of leakage may be prevented"}]</data>
