  <data key="d6">["interrupt", "drop", "improve", "absorb", "save", "have", "be", "expand", "depict", "decrease", "perform", "inhibit", "combine", "discharge", "accompany", "operate", "thermosette", "occur", "accommodate", "build in", "disclose", "describe", "supply", "melt", "prevent", "open", "go down", "instal", "seat", "fall", "localize", "carry out", "damage", "rotate", "measure", "characterize", "block", "increase", "insulate", "cause", "insert", "relate", "use", "equip", "sense", "lose", "arrange", "maintain", "predict", "influence", "burst", "detect", "foam", "include", "surround", "make", "freeze", "read", "determine", "utilize", "send", "mitigate", "install", "cover", "alleviate", "flow", "isolate", "stick", "warm", "manufacture", "inspect", "incorporate", "publish", "turn", "base", "keep", "solve", "lower", "change", "allow", "case", "mount", "break down", "show", "build", "expose", "heat", "leave", "generate", "reduce", "crack", "set", "attach", "pass", "adjust", "infringe", "configure", "look", "fill", "communicate", "provide", "take", "monitor", "relieve", "devise", "check", "receive", "introduce", "apply", "form", "deliver", "connect", "reach", "accord"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100339649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "to block the cold air and temperature of the outside to maintain the heat retention it is to prevent the malfunction or breakage of the instrument of the water meter 7 installed in (1)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100432779-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by blocking the external cold air double triple to maintain the underground temperature inside the protective casing (1) to prevent the rapid descent to below zero to prevent freezing of the water meter (2)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100432780-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it relates to a water meter protection tank to increase the temperature blocking force to prevent freezing of water meters and water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100513311-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water meter protection container is a device to prevent the water meter from freezing or being damaged by external impact in the winter when the temperature is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100518072-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in addition, there is no fear of freezing of the water meter because the water meter not only rotates during the flow of water but also freezes the water at low temperatures"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100535375-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, when the temperature is very low, simply insulating the water meter cannot prevent the freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100554870-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is possible to completely prevent the occurrence of an accident in advance.as described above, the present invention can effectively prevent the freezing phenomenon generated in the winter when the atmospheric temperature drops below zero in the section where the water meter for measuring the water consumption of the consumer such as a home or a shopping mall is installed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100722480-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "recently, in order to prevent the water meter from freezing due to a sudden drop in temperature, the internal air is directly inserted into the water meter storage box 100 or the water meter protection tube 200 so that external air is directly connected to the water meter 300"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100886893-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water metering box protective casing cap is installed in a protective casing because it cannot block the ground temperature during the cold winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100918589-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "or, in order to prevent freezing of water meters and water pipes in the past, a large amount of foamed polystyrene (styrofoam) is built into a single-walled protective case, but the freezing of water meters and water pipes is prevented in cold weather or cold regions falling below a certain temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100960607-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the outside air temperature drops to below zero in winter, it must be accompanied with proper insulation to prevent freezing of the water meter and the water pipe connected to the water meter, and a configuration that can be opened to read the amount of usage in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101214677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the second support 250 may not only prevent the water meter 10 itself from freezing or freezing due to winter outdoor temperature, but also may be made of transparent glass so that the number of the display unit 220 can be easily read"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101225602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water temperature is low in the winter when the water meter is frozen, the expansion pressure applied from the upper part to the lower part of the counter 30 is alleviated to perform a buffering action to prevent freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "receiving temperature information of the water flowing through the water pipe from the smart water meter, receiving outdoor temperature information from the meteorological server, and determining whether a water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the temperature information of the water in the water pipes and the outside temperature information, if the water meter determines that there is a risk of freezing waves, it provides a freeze prevention system of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is provided with outdoor temperature information from the water pipes, and judges whether the water meter is in danger of freezing in accordance with the water temperature information of the water pipes and the outside temperature information, and if it is determined that the water meter is in danger of freezing, to the user wire / wireless terminal of the water meter it provides a management server, characterized in that to send a freezing warning"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "(step s403) next, the management server 800 determines whether there is a freezing risk by combining the outdoor temperature information received from the meteorological server 90 and the temperature information of water in the water pipe received from the smart water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255061-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "(step s505) in this case, as in the above-described step s404, the management server 800 combines the outside temperature information received from the meteorological server 90 with the temperature information of the water of the water pipe received from the smart water meter, thereby freezing hazards"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101290447-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if it is carried out, if the freeze-expansive force of the tap water is generated by the fall of the ambient temperature in the winter, it is easily delivered to the airbag 430 through the freeze-expansion force inlet 11 and is absorbed to prevent freezing damage of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101369585-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in recent years, the temperature drop sharply occurs especially due to the abnormal temperature, and this causes the water meter freezing frequency to increase significantly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101404540-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when there is a risk of freezing of the water meter m due to a drop in winter temperature and a rapid drop in the temperature of the tap water, the temperature of the heating wire w can be detected from the temperature information detected by the temperature sensor 100 and the flow rate information detected by the flow sensor 200, or not"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the conventional water meter, due to the icing of the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature, frequent occurrence of freezing accidents occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-0926266.the present invention relates to a water meter which is capable of reducing the expansion pressure caused by the freezing of the interior of a winter casing having a low temperature in a prior art water meter, thereby remarkably decreasing the functionality and durability of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the elastic cover 50 is a function of preventing the frost accident of the water meter by relieving the inflation pressure due to the freezing of the inside of the winter casing 10 having a low temperature, as shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101423708-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, when the inside of the winter casing having a low temperature is frozen, , the expansion pressure due to freezing is sufficiently mitigated, thereby preventing the accident of the water meter from being frozen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101432240-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a conventional water meter is a method for preventing freezing in winter when the temperature is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101494087-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "also, the lid 120 isolates the space 10 inside the frame 100 to prevent inflow of outside air at a low temperature, thereby further lowering the possibility of freezing the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101528163-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this water meter is exposed to the outside for easy access to check the amount of water meter, so when the outside temperature goes down to freezing in winter, the water meter breaks down due to the frozen wave and sometimes the function is lost"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101542382-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10-2004-0013366 (published on february 14, 2004) in embodiments of the present invention, tap water flows automatically so that the water meter can not be frozen when the water reaches a temperature at which the water inside the water meter can be frozen even if the user does not use tap water, thereby preventing freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101568929-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the protective box 10 is configured to be able to prevent a frost caused by a temperature change due to an external impact and a season while accommodating the water meter m so as to accommodate a thermosetting material such as styrofoam although it is not shown inside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101861841-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a water meter has a protective box due to a problem of breakage or freezing due to external impact and temperature difference due to the season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101978152-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "also, the lid 120 isolates the space 10 inside the frame 100 to prevent inflow of outside air at a low temperature, thereby further lowering the possibility of freezing the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102075865-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, the heating device is further mounted on the water meter inside the main body of the protector to sense the temperature inside the main body of the winter protector to warm the water meter, thereby preventing the freezing of the water meter and improving the safety of the product.1 is an exploded perspective view of the water meter protector of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it relates to a water meter protection box using geothermal heat that can prevent freezing of water meters as geothermal heat higher than the average temperature flows into the protection tube through a geothermal tube inserted deep into the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the temperature of the geothermal 3 can be kept constant even if the outside temperature drops below zero because it flows in, it is possible to prevent freezing of the water meter 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the heat insulating material 20 is seated and inserted on the upper side of the inner water meter 1 of the protective tube 10 to block the cold outside and maintain the temperature to prevent freezing of the water meter 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it provides the effect of preventing freezing of water meters by introducing geothermal heat higher than the temperature into the protective tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for this reason, although a separate heat insulating material is installed in the portion where the water meter is installed, when the external temperature is very low, there is a problem that the heat insulating material does not prevent the meter from freezing.document 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2 is an operation diagram showing a color change according to a temperature change of the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 in the water meter 100 equipped with a freezing temperature prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the water meter 100 provided with the freezing wave prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 has a second set temperature (eg, -5 degrees) that is lower than the first set temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the water meter 100 equipped with the freezing wave prediction sheet according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction temperature sheet 150 has a first color at a first set temperature (for example, 0 degrees celsius) or more"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to detect a color change based on the temperature of tap water, it is provided (strictly attached) to the outer shell 110 of the water meter 100, and the freezing prediction temperature sheet 150 includes the water meter 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102116121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the water meter 100 equipped with a freezing sheet for predicting a freezing wave according to an embodiment of the present invention, the second zion region 152 is equal to or less than a second set temperature (eg, -5 degrees c)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for this reason, a separate thermal insulation material may be installed at the part where the water meter is installed, but when the external temperature is very low, there is a problem that such thermal insulation material cannot prevent freezing of the meter.document 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "4 is an operation diagram showing a color change according to a temperature change of the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the freeze prediction sheet 150 is characterized in that the color changes according to the temperature of the outside air in which the water meter 100 is installed, so that the user can directly check the possibility of freezing of the water meter 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is a water meter 100 in order to change color based on the temperature of tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102158188-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "7, in the freezing wave prediction water meter system according to an embodiment of the present invention, the freezing wave prediction zion sheet 150 is color based on the temperature of the tap water passing through the fluid passage hole 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102263501-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water meter freeze protection cover freezing protection cover for water meter the present disclosure relates to a water meter freeze protection cover, and more particularly, to a water meter freeze protection cover for preventing the water meter from freezing due to a decrease in external temperature in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102263501-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "embodiments disclosed herein are installed to surround the outer surface of the water meter, to provide a water meter freeze protection cover that can prevent the water meter from freezing even at a low temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102300746-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this traditional method has a disadvantage in that it is not effective in preventing freezing of the water meter and water pipe due to the problem of thermal insulation when the external temperature is very low below -5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102300746-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, it is possible to prevent the water meter and water pipe from freezing in advance by adjusting the freezing point (freezing point) of water according to the external temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102346405-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a temporary measure has difficulty in preventing freezing of the water meter and water pipe due to the thermal insulation problem when the external temperature is very low below -5 c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the outside air temperature drops below freezing in winter, proper insulation must be accompanied to prevent freezing and bursting of the water meter and the water pipe connected to the water meter, and an open configuration must be taken to allow meter reading of usage even in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102466363-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in general, when the outside temperature drops below freezing, such as in winter, the water flowing inside the main body of the water meter freezes and expands, and the expansion force may cause a freeze phenomenon that damages the glass cover of the meter or damages the meter itself"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102683498-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however, since water meters as described above must be checked or inspected frequently, they are generally installed outdoors rather than indoors, so it is not uncommon for them to easily freeze and burst due to low temperatures in the winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102725459-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however, as water meters like the above need to be checked or inspected regularly, they are usually installed outdoors rather than indoors, so they are prone to freezing due to low temperatures in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200163413-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "insulation cover for water meter thermos cover of city water gauge the present invention relates to a heat cover for water meter to prevent freezing of the water meter when the temperature is sharp"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190678-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventionally, in order to prevent freezing of water meters and water pipes in an apartment water tanker or a water meter protection container, many schiropols are built in the water meter and water pipes to prevent freezing in cold weather or cold regions falling below a certain temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200230541-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to this problem, the supply of tap water is interrupted during the winter, and the tap water has to be supplied after melting the tap with hot water or heat.if the temperature drops too much, the water meter freezes due to the freezing of the water meter due to rapid freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200266383-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it prevents water meter from freezing even during the cold winter season, and it saves much manpower and time due to reconstruction.when it is used for a long time, the protection box is cracked or damaged due to earth pressure or temperature change"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "freeze prevention device of water meter frozen to burst prevent of water gauge the present invention relates to a device for preventing the freezing of the water meter, in particular to install a heating wire in the lower portion of the water meter and to operate when the outside temperature is below the freezing point to prevent the freeze of the water meter in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "looking at the conventional technology for preventing the freezing of the water meter as described above, the temperature around the water meter by filling the insulating material in the water meter protection box with the water meter installed or by installing a heat insulating material in the lid installed on the upper surface of the water meter protection box to prevent the freezing point below"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200301700-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and the purpose of the present invention is to prevent the water meter from freezing by heating the bottom of the water meter when the outside temperature decreases"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302626-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an anti-freezing-burst type water meter the present invention relates to a water meter, and more particularly, to a freeze-proof water meter to accommodate the air into the water meter to prevent freezing caused by a sudden drop in temperature in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302627-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "an anti-freezing-burst type water meter the present invention relates to a water meter, and more particularly to a freeze-proof water meter having a drain portion for discharging water in accordance with the temperature drop in the lower portion of the water meter to prevent freezing caused by the temperature drop in the winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302627-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the present invention includes a drain portion for discharging water at the lower part of the water meter according to the temperature drop, so as to prevent freezing caused by the temperature drop in winter, the freeze is easily prevented according to the change in temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200302638-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional water-meter protection tube is manufactured by installing a heat insulating material to prevent freezing of water taps and water meters in winter, but in the cold districts where the outside temperature is below 20 c, the protection tube structure applied with such a heat insulating material structure does not show any effect"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200307663-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "to solve the problem of excessive input of metering manpower and metering time due to the use of meter box and freezing of water meter which is easy to occur due to external temperature drop, the function was improved"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200310432-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "above all, freezing occurs due to a decrease in the external temperature of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200312057-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, when the temperature is very low, simply insulating the water meter cannot prevent the freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200335080-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional water meter protection tube is manufactured by installing a heat insulating material to prevent freezing of water taps and water meters in winter, but in the cold districts where the outside air temperature is below 20 c, there is a problem that the protection tube structure using such a heat insulating material does not show any effect"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200372345-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if you install the water meter outside the building as described above, there is an advantage that the meter reading staff can easily read, and the privacy is not infringed during the metering process, but it is installed outdoors in the winter season where the freezing is low due to the low outside temperature this will provide a cause for freezing of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200373667-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, if the water meter is exposed to freezing temperatures below zero in winter, the water inside the water meter expands due to the water freezing inside, and thus freezing occurs in the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200375794-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventionally, in order to prevent freezing of the water meter, a case covering the outer shell of the water meter is formed, and a heating line is built in the case, or on one side of the number counter in the water meter for heating while sensing the temperature of water in the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200387639-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, warm geothermal heat is introduced in the winter season, so that the temperature inside the water meter protector can maintain a temperature similar to that of the geothermal temperature, thereby preventing freezing of water meters and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "fitting projection line the present invention relates to a water meter freeze protection device, and more particularly to a water meter freeze protection device that can maintain a constant temperature at room temperature to prevent freezing of the water meter pipe in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200415979-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, since water meters installed in buildings such as apartment complexes are installed in corridors that are not heated, they are easily influenced by temperature and are easily frozen when the temperature drops sharply, thus exposing more of them to the risk of freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430457-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meter lid 5.heating wire the conventional technique is to install a heating wire in the shape of caps on the outside of the water meter and to arrange a sensor to heat it when the temperature is below a certain temperature to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430463-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventional water meter is to be installed in the thermal insulation case to prevent freezing in winter, but there is a limit to the thermal insulation capacity of the thermal insulation case and if water is left inside the meter, it is frozen when the temperature drops, so it cannot be completely prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the object of the present invention is to provide a self-heating function to maintain the water meter main body at a certain temperature even in winter to prevent frost condensation or condensation on the outside surface of the water meter main body in winter, in particular, it is to provide a water-coil built-in water meter to prevent winter freezing accidents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430528-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "conventional water meter protection box is installed in the water meter inside of the water meter in the water meter to prevent the water meter from freezing in winter, but the water meter is stuck in the water meter when the temperature drops rapidly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200487219-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this water meter 10, tap water is allowed to pass through the water meter, so that when the air temperature falls below freezing in winter, tap water passing through the water meter is frozen, and thus the water meter 10 is frequently frozen"}, {"pat_id": "US-11095960-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thus, a single set of localized sensors (flow rate sensor 105, optional pressure sensor 65, optional acoustic sensor, and/or optional temperature sensor 93) can be utilized and incorporated into the water meter and leak detection system 10 (126 shown in figs"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "for measuring or monitoring the temperature of the water flowing through the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, the use of various thermocouples or thermistor sensors 70 as depicted in fig"}, {"pat_id": "US-11549837-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "furthermore, be communicating with a home router, the water meter and leak detection system 10, 126, 200 can communicate with intelligent thermostats sending a signal to turn on the residential or corporation heat to a temperature that will inhibit freezing water in the residential and corporation interior water pipes"}]</data>
