  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100649139-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, in the coupling method using the flanges 11 and 31, there is a high possibility that leakage occurs at the coupling site due to ground subsidence or vibration at the coupling site, and in order to prevent this, it is best to fix it by welding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100926947-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the coupling of the coupling device is loose due to ground subsidence or vibration, there is a high risk of water leakage into the gap between the water supply pipe and the connection pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200436180-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and even if the water well or the pipe is distorted due to ground subsidence and external impact, the watertight coupling state is maintained to completely prevent the occurrence of leakage"}]</data>
